tore the latest base backup and replay the WAL archive up to the named restore point created when the freeze started (point-in-time recovery, per ops/RUNBOOK.md).\", \"i_attempted_writes\": false}\n```"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1277, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16722, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1277}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "464ed185-0d40-451f-bcbd-c4760565f81c", "uuid": "54a59728-c269-424e-8f72-b59c8cc177d6", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T13:15:19.756Z", "request_id": "req_011CgcGbTimPNDoYoPd3oTX3"}
